  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tGeneral\n\t\tGeneral\n\n### How to set up a Direct Debit\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 26 Sep, 2025 at  1:34 PM\n\n\t\tWelcome to this quick guide on how to set up a Direct Debit. This guide will walk you through the essential steps.\n\nDirect Debit\n\nNavigation:  My Admin > My Subscription > Subscription > Payment Methods\n\nTo set up a Direct Debit navigate to My Admin, click on My Subscription then click on subscription.  \n\nThis will take you to the Subscription Portal, navigate to Payment Methods and set up your Direct Debit.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
